SendInput `
(
Hello,

When a job runs out of the variables that were loaded, scout gets put into an error and shows up on a report.  The job(s) listed below have had this occur.  Please load additional variables to the listed job(s) and then submit an un-expire task requesting to have wave 2 un-expired to have the scout activity resumed.  For now, the listed job(s) have been expired to prevent further occurrences of the error caused by not having enough variables loaded.

Job#: %DESTATUSJNUM%

Thank you,
Michael A. Smith
)
Return

